  "description": "HexaEngine.Sappho is a high-performance, source-generated binary serialization library for .NET with support for polymorphism, cyclic references, and efficient memory management. Designed as a submodule of the HexaEngine game engine, it provides fast binary serialization suitable for game state persistence, network communication, asset management, and complex object graph serialization.",
